Samajh gaya. Asal maqsad simple hai, to seedha raasta deta hoon. Ye kaam aap laptop par khud abhi kar sakte hain, Claude Code ka intezar kiye baghair. Sirf teen cheezein raasta rokti hain: app sirf apne liye sun rahi ho, Windows Firewall, aur laptop ka so jaana.

1. App ko network par kholein

D:\final-expense-app\.env file Notepad mein kholein. Agar HOST=127.0.0.1 likha hai to usay badal kar ye karein:

HOST=0.0.0.0

Save karein aur app band karke dobara chalayein, jaise aap chalate hain.

2. Check karein ke sun rahi hai

Normal PowerShell mein:

netstat -ano | findstr 5180

0.0.0.0:5180 ... LISTENING aana chahiye. Agar abhi bhi 127.0.0.1:5180 aaye to ruk jayein aur output yahan bhejein.

3. Firewall kholein (Administrator PowerShell)

Start menu mein "PowerShell" likhein, right-click karke "Run as administrator". Phir pehle ye:

Get-NetConnectionProfile

Agar NetworkCategory mein Public likha ho, to usay Private karein (Wi-Fi ki jagah wo naam likhein jo InterfaceAlias mein aaya):

Set-NetConnectionProfile -InterfaceAlias "Wi-Fi" -NetworkCategory Private

Phir port kholein:

New-NetFirewallRule -DisplayName "Final Expense App 5180" -Direction Inbound -Protocol TCP -LocalPort 5180 -Action Allow -Profile Private

4. Doosre laptop se test

Kisi doosre laptop ke browser mein:

http://10.120.19.237:5180

Login page khul jaye to kaam ho gaya.

5. Server ko sone na dein

Settings → System → Power: jab charger laga ho tab screen aur sleep dono "Never" kar dein. Aur Control Panel → Power Options → "Choose what closing the lid does" mein "When plugged in" ke liye Do nothing. Laptop charger par hi rakhein.

Agar step 4 par na khule

Doosre Windows laptop par PowerShell mein ye chalayein:

Test-NetConnection 10.120.19.237 -Port 5180

Agar TcpTestSucceeded : True aaye to masla browser ka hai. Agar False aaye aur upar ke sab steps theek hain, to shayad router laptops ko aapas mein baat nahi karne deta (client isolation). Wo router ki setting hai, us ka output yahan bhej dein.

Ek aakhri baat: 10.120.19.237 abhi ka IP hai, router kabhi kabhi badal deta hai. Agar kisi din sab ka URL achanak band ho jaye to pehle laptop ka IP check karein. Pakka hal router mein us laptop ka IP "reserve" karna hai, wo baad mein kar lenge.
